<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl"> <head> <meta charset="UTF-8"> <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>MMD VPN</title>
<style> * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; } body { min-height: 100vh; background: #05070b; color: white; padding: 20px; } .container { max-width: 500px; margin: auto; } .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px; } .logo { width: 75px; height: 75px; margin: auto; border-radius: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #008cff, #003f91); font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; } .header h1 { margin-top: 15px; font-size: 26px; } .header p { margin-top: 8px; color: #8b9bae; } .card { background: #0b1119; border: 1px solid #17324d; border-radius: 20px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 15px; } .card-title { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 18px; } .active { background: #062a4d; color: #42aaff; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; } .info { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; } .info-box { background: #070b10; border: 1px solid #172433; border-radius: 15px; padding: 14px; } .info-box span { display: block; color: #8092a5; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 8px; } .info-box strong { font-size: 14px; } .usage { margin-top: 20px; } .usage-top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 12px; } .progress { height: 10px; background: #17202b; border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; } .progress-bar { width: 36%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #006cff, #00aaff); } .link-box { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 20px; } .link-box input { width: 100%; min-width: 0; background: #070b10; border: 1px solid #1b3045; border-radius: 12px; color: white; padding: 12px; direction: ltr; } button { border: none; border-radius: 12px; padding: 0 16px; color: white; background: #006cff; font-weight: bold; } .qr-section { text-align: center; } .qr { width: 160px; height: 160px; background: white; color: black; margin: 15px auto; border-radius: 15px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; } .buttons { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; } .btn { text-decoration: none; text-align: center; padding: 14px; border-radius: 14px; background: #111c28; border: 1px solid #1d344c; color: white; } .primary { background: #006cff; } footer { text-align: center; color: #617386; font-size: 11px; margin-top: 25px; } footer b { color: #0099ff; } @media (max-width: 400px) { .info { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .buttons { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } } </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
<div class="header"> <div class="logo">MMD</div> <h1>MMD VPN</h1> <p>پنل مدیریت اشتراک</p> </div>
<div class="card">
<div class="card-title"> <h2>اطلاعات اشتراک</h2> <span class="active">فعال</span> </div>
<div class="info">
<div class="info-box"> <span>نام کاربر</span> <strong>MMD User</strong> </div>
<div class="info-box"> <span>نوع سرویس</span> <strong>نامحدود</strong> </div>
<div class="info-box"> <span>تاریخ شروع</span> <strong>1405/06/20</strong> </div>
<div class="info-box"> <span>تاریخ انقضا</span> <strong>1405/07/20</strong> </div>
</div>
<div class="usage">
<div class="usage-top"> <span>میزان مصرف</span> <span>36%</span> </div>
<div class="progress"> <div class="progress-bar"></div> </div>
</div>
<div class="link-box">
<input>
id="subscriptionLink"
type="text"
readonly
value="https://example.com/sub/MMD123456"
<button onclick="copyLink()">کپی</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="card qr-section">
<h2>QR اشتراک</h2>
<div class="qr"> QR CODE </div>
<p>برای اتصال سریع، QR کد را اسکن کنید.</p>
</div>
